  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Influencing And Learning in Nepal (DIAL Nepal)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIAL Nepal, a small programme, is being implemented to achieve British Embassy Kathmandu (BEK)&#x2019;s overall policy and influencing objectives through supporting provincial and local governments on innovative and need-based development needs. The programme aims to support and collaborate with key interlocutors, on building relationships and influencing policy reforms for development impact, in line with BEK&#x2019;s campaign goals.</narrative>
  </description>
